---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/utils';
---
<aside class="tester-banner">
  <div class="tb-icon"><Icon name="flask" size={30} /></div>
  <div class="tb-text">
    <span class="eyebrow">Cerchiamo tester Android</span>
    <h2>Prova in anteprima le nostre app, gratis</h2>
    <p>Ci serve una mano per portare le nostre app sul Play Store. Installi la versione di prova, la usi un po' per 14 giorni e ci dici cosa ne pensi. Niente costi, niente abbonamenti.</p>
  </div>
  <a href={url('/diventa-tester/')} class="btn btn-primary">Voglio partecipare <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
</aside>

<style>
  .tester-banner {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 32px 36px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.35), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, rgba(24, 214, 196, 0.28), transparent 55%),
      var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  .tb-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--gradient);
    color: #fff;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .tester-banner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
